        "兩個做法本質相同：都是平方差",
        "$x\\ge0$ 才能這樣寫；$x\\to4$ 時 $x$ 是正的，沒問題"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\lim_{x\\to4}\\frac{\\sqrt x-2}{x-4}",
        "\\frac{x-4}{(x-4)(\\sqrt x+2)}=\\frac1{\\sqrt x+2}\\to\\frac14",
        "x-4=(\\sqrt x)^2-2^2=(\\sqrt x-2)(\\sqrt x+2)",
        "\\frac{\\sqrt x-2}{(\\sqrt x-2)(\\sqrt x+2)}=\\frac1{\\sqrt x+2}\\to\\frac14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "④ 兩個根號相減",
