        "共軛：$\\sqrt{1+x}+\\sqrt{1-x}$；平方差把兩個根號都消掉：",
        "根號在分母也一樣："
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\sqrt{1+x}-\\sqrt{1-x}}{x}",
        "(\\sqrt{1+x})^2-(\\sqrt{1-x})^2=(1+x)-(1-x)=2x",
        "\\frac{2x}{x(\\sqrt{1+x}+\\sqrt{1-x})}=\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1+x}+\\sqrt{1-x}}\\to\\frac{2}{1+1}=1",
        "\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{x+4}-2}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "④ $x\\to\\infty$ 的 $\\infty-\\infty$",
